{
  "uid": "trace-correlation",
  "title": "Trace Correlation",
  "tags": [
    "traces",
    "exemplars",
    "repro"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Repro Overview",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/repro-overview",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Traces Drilldown",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/a/grafana-exploretraces-app/explore",
      "icon": "external link"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "product",
        "label": "Product",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "sort": 1,
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(http_transaction_duration_seconds_bucket, product)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(http_transaction_duration_seconds_bucket, product)"
      },
      {
        "name": "consume_type",
        "label": "Channel",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "sort": 1,
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(http_transaction_duration_seconds_bucket, consume_type)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(http_transaction_duration_seconds_bucket, consume_type)"
      },
      {
        "name": "min_duration",
        "label": "Min duration",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "0ms,25ms,50ms,80ms,100ms,250ms,1s",
        "current": {
          "text": "50ms",
          "value": "50ms"
        },
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "trace_id",
        "label": "Trace ID",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Metrics: every diamond is one sampled request — hover it, then \"View trace\"",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": [],
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Response time p50 / p95 / p99 (with exemplars)",
      "description": "From the bounded histogram http_transaction_duration_seconds. Exemplars are trace ids the OTel SDK kept for sampled requests, one per bucket per export; they are not labels, so they add no series.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(http_transaction_duration_seconds_bucket{product=~\"${product:regex}\", consume_type=~\"${consume_type:regex}\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "exemplar": false,
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_transaction_duration_seconds_bucket{product=~\"${product:regex}\", consume_type=~\"${consume_type:regex}\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "exemplar": true,
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_transaction_duration_seconds_bucket{product=~\"${product:regex}\", consume_type=~\"${consume_type:regex}\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "exemplar": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to drill in",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Metric → sample → trace**, like Application Insights' *Drill into samples*:\n\n1. **Diamonds** on the charts are exemplars: real sampled requests. Hover one and click **View trace**.\n2. **Samples** below lists sampled transactions slower than *min duration* (top bar) for the selected product/channel. Click a **Trace ID** to open its waterfall at the bottom of this page.\n3. In a trace, a span's **Related metrics** link goes back to p95 and throughput *for that product and channel*.\n4. For breakdowns and comparisons (*which attribute makes the slow requests slow?*), open [**Traces Drilldown**](/a/grafana-exploretraces-app/explore): select a duration range on its histogram, then **Comparison** / **Traces**.\n\nNeeds `make tracing` and `make traces-on`. Only *sampled* requests (`TRACE_SAMPLE_RATIO`) have traces; the metrics count every request."
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "Response-time distribution (buckets/s, with exemplars)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "yAxis": {
          "unit": "s",
          "axisPlacement": "left"
        },
        "rowsFrame": {
          "layout": "auto"
        },
        "color": {
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Blues",
          "steps": 64,
          "exponent": 0.5,
          "fill": "dark-blue",
          "reverse": false
        },
        "cellGap": 1,
        "exemplars": {
          "color": "rgba(255,120,0,0.9)"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "yHistogram": true
        },
        "legend": {
          "show": true
        },
        "filterValues": {
          "le": 1e-09
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (le) (rate(http_transaction_duration_seconds_bucket{product=~\"${product:regex}\", consume_type=~\"${consume_type:regex}\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "exemplar": true,
          "range": true,
          "format": "heatmap"
        }
      ],
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Transactions / s by state (with exemplars)",
      "description": "Exemplars on a counter: one recent sampled request per series. Failed transactions' traces carry an error status.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (state) (rate(http_transactions_total{consume_type=~\"${consume_type:regex}\", product=~\"${product:regex}\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}",
          "exemplar": true,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "id": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Samples: sampled transactions from Tempo (click a Trace ID)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": [],
      "id": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Slow samples (duration ≥ min duration)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 14,
        "h": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "traceID"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Show this trace below",
                    "url": "/d/trace-correlation/trace-correlation?${__url_time_range}&${product:queryparam}&${consume_type:queryparam}&${min_duration:queryparam}&var-trace_id=${__value.raw}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Duration",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"transactions-api\" && kind=server && span.transaction.product=~\"${product:regex}\" && span.transaction.consume_type=~\"${consume_type:regex}\" && duration >= $min_duration} | select(span.transaction.state, span.transaction.product, span.transaction.consume_type, resource.service.instance.id)",
          "limit": 50,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Failed samples",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 14,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 10,
        "h": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "traceID"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Show this trace below",
                    "url": "/d/trace-correlation/trace-correlation?${__url_time_range}&${product:queryparam}&${consume_type:queryparam}&${min_duration:queryparam}&var-trace_id=${__value.raw}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Duration",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"transactions-api\" && kind=server && span.transaction.product=~\"${product:regex}\" && span.transaction.consume_type=~\"${consume_type:regex}\" && status = error} | select(span.transaction.state, span.transaction.product, span.transaction.consume_type, resource.service.instance.id)",
          "limit": 50,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "id": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Trace (end-to-end transaction)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": [],
      "id": 9
    },
    {
      "type": "traces",
      "title": "Trace ${trace_id}",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "${trace_id}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 10
    }
  ]
}